     1 6H SHEAR 3X,12HTRANS. AXIAL 3X,12HCOMB. MOMENT 3X,12HCOMB. RADIALCAN 0633
     2/3X,3HNO.3X, 8HLENGTH   4X, 6HRADIUS 6X,12HIN.-LBS./IN. 3X, 8HLBS.CAN 0634
     3/IN.7X,13HLOAD LBS./IN.2X,12HIN.-LBS./IN.3X,14HSHEAR LBS./IN./9X, CAN 0635
