     1E / 5X 4HNOS. 9X,12HINTERSECTION 9X,10HDEFLECTION 9X,16HAXIAL DEFLCAN 0656
     2ECTION / 18X,10HRADIANSXE6 11X,9HINCHESXE6 10X,9HINCHESXE6 //)    CAN 0657
      GO TO (4027,4021),NSTR                                            CAN 0658
